"Smoothing for textured artwork in the in-game menus. Applies with upscaling "
"or subpixel geometry."
msgstr "在遊戲中選單中平滑的文字化藝術品。 應用於升級或子像素几何 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Smooth"
msgstr "平滑"

