msgstr "將整個選單縮放至其基數大小的%d %% (100%%使用整像素來做最尖的影像) 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"In this window it goes no smaller than %d%% (a window pixel for each of the "
"game's)."
msgstr "在此視窗內, 它不會小於%d %% (每款遊戲的視窗像素) 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"In this window it goes no larger than %d%% (the game's 320 x 216 screen "
"filling it)."
msgstr "在這個視窗裡,它不會大于%d %%(遊戲的320 x 216屏幕填充)."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Changes the text size without resizing the menu."
msgstr "更改文字大小而不重新大小選單 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "This menu's windows darker than the game's grey."
msgstr "這個菜單的窗口比遊戲的灰色更暗."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
