msgstr "這菜單的窗戶在遊戲的半透明的灰色。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Auto-scroll"
msgstr "自動旋轉"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Long descriptions in the message box below scroll gently on their own after "
