msgid ""
"Only the font in the BIOS image is used (save titles, some text over "
"movies): a file chosen here, else a 512 KB .bin in the disc folder. It is "
"read where it is and never copied."
msgstr ""
"只使用 BIOS 影像中的字型( 儲存標題, 有些文字翻譯為電影 ) : 這裡選取的檔案, 其它的磁碟目錄中為 512 KB.bin 。 它會被讀取, "
"永遠不會复制 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "Look beside the disc"
msgstr "看著碟子旁邊"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid "No BIOS image beside the disc or in the save folder"
msgstr "光碟旁或儲存資料夾中沒有 BIOS 影像"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Only the font in the BIOS image is used (save titles, some text over "
"movies). The image is read where it is and never copied."
msgstr "只使用 BIOS 影像中的字型( 儲存標題, 有些文字翻譯為電影 ) 。 影像會被讀取到它的位置, 永遠不會复制 。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
